# spoton-lite CODEOWNERS — drives both real merge gating AND audit-team auto-watch.
# AI Reviewer's path-based signal layer reads from this file.
#
# Format reminder (GitHub):
#   <pattern>  <owner1> <owner2> ...
#
# Branch-protection rules require N approvals from CODEOWNERS for matching paths.
# Audit team is added as a parallel observer — non-required, just notified.

# ---------- Tier 3 paths (PCI / payments / auth / KYC / crypto) ----------
# Real owners gate merge:
/api/payments/**         @spoton/payments-team @spoton/security-leads
/api/auth/**             @spoton/security-team
/api/kyc/**              @spoton/compliance-team
/api/crypto/**           @spoton/security-team

# Audit team auto-watch (parallel · observer · non-required):
/api/payments/**         @spoton/security-audit
/api/auth/**             @spoton/security-audit
/api/kyc/**              @spoton/security-audit
/api/crypto/**           @spoton/security-audit

# ---------- Tier 4 paths (migrations on payment tables · IAM · CI) ----------
/migrations/**           @spoton/payments-team @spoton/security-leads @spoton/sre
/.github/workflows/**    @spoton/sre @spoton/security-leads
/infra/iam/**            @spoton/security-leads @spoton/sre

# ---------- Tier 2 paths (business logic · non-PCI backend) ----------
/api/orders/**           @spoton/backend-team
/api/notifications/**    @spoton/backend-team
/api/users/**            @spoton/backend-team
/api/inventory/**        @spoton/backend-team
/api/menu/**             @spoton/backend-team
/api/reporting/**        @spoton/backend-team
/api/reports/**          @spoton/backend-team

# ---------- Tier 1 paths (frontend · non-payment UI) ----------
/web/src/components/**   @spoton/frontend-team
/web/src/pages/**        @spoton/frontend-team
/web/src/hooks/**        @spoton/frontend-team

# ---------- Tier 0 paths (docs · tests · styles) ----------
# (no required reviewer · falls through to repo default)
/docs/**
/web/src/styles/**
**/*_test.go
